          "items": [
            "Welcome to Serene Cassine, your peaceful retreat just a 5-minute stroll from Seagrove’s white sand beaches. This 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom townhome in Cassine Gardens sleeps 6 and includes 6 bikes, a fully equipped kitchen, 2 pools, tennis courts, and nature trails. Enjoy quiet mornings on screened porches and explore all that 30A has to offer. Ideal for beach lovers, families, and laid-back getaways!<br><br>☼ Located in Cassine Gardens, just 5 minutes from beach access<br>☼ Fully equipped kitchen with dishwasher & Keurig<br>☼ Complimentary Wi-Fi<br>☼ 5 adult bikes + 1 teen-sized bike with locks included<br>☼ In-unit washer/dryer<br>☼ Private screened-in porch on main level<br>☼ Access to 2 community pools, tennis & pickleball courts, basketball hoop, picnic area, nature trails & scenic pond<br>☼ Walking distance to Seagrove dining + minutes to Seaside & WaterColor<br>☼ Local wildlife viewing (at a safe distance!)<br><br>Layout & Sleeping Arrangements:<br>☼ 2nd Floor: King primary suite with front deck<br>☼ 2nd Floor: Queen bedroom with screened balcony<br>☼ 1st Floor: Queen sofa pullout in living room<br><br>Home Amenities:<br>☼ 6 beach chairs<br>☼ 1 beach cart<br>☼ 2 coolers<br>☼ 6 adult sized bikes<br>☼ Helmets<br><br>Closest Beach Access Point:<br>☼ One Seagrove Beach Access<br>→ 55 Seagrove Pl, Santa Rosa Beach, FL 32459<br>→ ADA-accessible ramp<br>→ Bike racks<br>→ Seasonal lifeguards<br><br>Guest Access:<br>☼ Full access to 2 assigned parking spots right outside the door<br>☼ Full access to 2 pools, trails, and community amenities<br>☼ 5 adult bikes + 1 teen bike included with stay<br><br>30A Beach Stays provides a few starter essentials to kick off your stay:<br>We’ve stocked the home with starter essentials:<br>☼ Full Bath: Travel Size shampoo, conditioner, hand/face bar, massage body bar, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Half Bath: Hand soap, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Kitchen: 2 dishwasher pods, 2 laundry pods, 1 sponge, small dish soap, 1 roll of paper towels<br>☼ Trash Bags: A few liners per bathroom & kitchen bins<br>If you're staying longer or need more of anything, let us know — we're happy to recommend the closest grocery or convenience stores!<br><br>☼ A signed rental agreement is required before check-in. This agreement only needs to be signed by the guest who booked.<br>☼ Guests ages 18–24 with no one in the group over 25 will be required to pay a security deposit.<br><br>For your safety, we have exterior cameras that record audio and video only when motion is detected.<br>☼ EXTERIOR USE ONLY ☼<br><br>DWE7604931<br>STR24-000960",
