        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Everything was clean, organized, provided many essentials. Such a cozy home to stay in. The shower on the bottom floor was so handy when getting back from the beach. Also lovely neighbors and area.Hosts provided a lot and check-in and check-out was very easy.A amazing stay! We loved the amount of towels provided as well! Very nice 10/10!!!",
