            "response": "Thank you! Can’t wait to have you back!!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We really loved Serene Cassine! The surrounding trees and the nearby pond were so peaceful and relaxing. The lodging itself had all we wanted and was very comfortable. And, just a few minute walk and we were at the beautiful beach! We will definitely be back!",
        "themes": [
