      },
      {
        "author": "Laura M.",
        "date": "2024-10-14T00:15:09Z",
        "id": "670c628dad557b76d63fa282",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Family of 4- 2 adults and 2 teens had a great trip! \nThe space was perfect and cozy, location was great to the beach and restaurants, & big plus that the bikes are included. \nMake sure you take a short walk or bike ride to eat at the perfect pig and have ice cream at pecan jacks. \nThe host was very responsive and helpful! Will definitely rebook here in the future!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Had a great time there for Fall break",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
