        "date": "2024-07-10T15:26:15Z",
        "id": "668ea817ebda3d66aec16d5e",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "My family and I had a lovely stay at Serene Cassine! Not only was the home beautiful and the beds comfortable but the hosts thoughtfully included a welcome basket and extra amenities throughout that were very convenient during the trip. The bikes included were also in great condition! Thanks, Ali—we’ll be back!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Truly Serene!",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
