        "text": "We were very pleased from the proximity to the beach, the available bikes and chairs and ample cook ware. I really appreciated the welcome basket with snacks and coffee pods as well as the charming book with helpful information such as restaurants and check in/out procedures. Ali was easy to communicate with. We look forward to coming back for a longer stay.",
        "themes": [
